{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Mimir (Grafana Cloud)",
      "description": "Stack de métricas que recebe o remote-write do Grafana Alloy.",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "grafana",
      "id": "grafana",
      "name": "Grafana",
      "version": "10.0.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "id": "timeseries",
      "name": "Time series",
      "version": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "id": "stat",
      "name": "Stat",
      "version": ""
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Requisições, status, latência e estado degradado da API. Log técnico vs analytics: aqui só telemetria de sistema; os números de negócio (leitores, cliques, receita) NÃO pertencem a este painel.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "API acessível (scrape)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(up{ambiente=\"$ambiente\", job=\"portal-api\"})",
          "legendFormat": "up",
          "range": true,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "time_series",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "`up` do scrape em `/metrics`. Zero aqui significa API inacessível para o coletor (ou token errado) — e é o que dispara `PortalColetorSemDados`.",
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Readiness (banco + migrations)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(portal_ready{ambiente=\"$ambiente\"})",
          "legendFormat": "portal_ready",
          "range": true,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "time_series",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "`/readyz`/`/health-detail` do Django. 0 = dependência obrigatória fora do ar; é o estado público que o check externo do Better Stack também observa.",
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Erros 5xx (taxa)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 9,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(portal_http_requests_total{ambiente=\"$ambiente\", status=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "5xx/s",
          "range": true,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "time_series",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Requisições com status 5xx por segundo, somadas. Operação normal: próximo de zero durante o dia e com picos proporcionais ao tráfego.",
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Respostas degradadas",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(increase(portal_degraded_responses_total{ambiente=\"$ambiente\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "degradadas no período",
          "range": true,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "time_series",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Respostas servidas em estado degradado (Redis/Celery/feed fora, com cache válido). Não é erro: é o aviso de que a resiliência está sendo usada. Acúmulo contínuo indica dependência caída há tempo demais.",
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requisições por status",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(portal_http_requests_total{ambiente=\"$ambiente\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "normal"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência da requisição (p50/p90/p95/p99)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(portal_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{ambiente=\"$ambiente\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "pp50",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.90, sum by (le) (rate(portal_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{ambiente=\"$ambiente\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "pp90",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(portal_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{ambiente=\"$ambiente\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "pp95",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(portal_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{ambiente=\"$ambiente\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "pp99",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "ms",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Histograma clássico (`portal_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket`) com os buckets padrão de `config/metrics.py`. p95 acima de ~800 ms já é perceptível para o usuário.",
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Rota mais lenta (top 5 por p95)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "topk(5, sum by (route) (histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, route) (rate(portal_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{ambiente=\"$ambiente\"}[$__rate_interval])))))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "ms",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "O rótulo de rota vem do middleware e é de baixa cardinalidade por construção (path não resolvido vira `unmatched`), então esta agregação é segura.",
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência por rota (média)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "topk(5, sum by (route) (rate(portal_http_request_duration_seconds_sum{ambiente=\"$ambiente\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum by (route) (rate(portal_http_request_duration_seconds_count{ambiente=\"$ambiente\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "ms",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
